{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06760","headline":"咏史 · 王昌龄","name":"咏史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荷畚至洛阳，杖策游北门。\n天下尽兵甲，豺狼满中原。\n明夷方遘患，顾我徒崩犇。\n自慙菲薄才，误蒙国士恩。\n位重任亦重，时危志弥敦。\n西北未及终，东南不可吞。\n进则耻保躬，退乃爲触藩。\n叹息嵩山老，而後知其尊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06760.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06760","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}